  m_text: "Welcome, prisoner...\nYou awaken in the cold, damp depths of a dungeon
    \u2014 a place where light fears to linger and screams echo endlessly. You don\u2019t
    remember how you got here, only that something evil keeps you trapped. Something
    that whispers in your mind.\n\nYour only goal: Escape. But freedom comes at a
    price.\n\nOnce you claw your way out of the depths, you\u2019ll face the real
    challenge \u2014 a twisted palace where reality warps and shadows fight back.
    There, you will confront the very force that imprisoned you: the Devil himself.\n\nControls\nW
    A S D \u2013 Move\nSpacebar \u2013 Jump / Shoot\nE / Left Mouse Click \u2013
    Interact\nESC \u2013\_Pause\_the\_game"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
